          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened/educated for airway, swelling, mental-status, and eye red flags.",
          "quote": "呼吸不畅、喉咙发紧或声音嘶哑"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00132",
          "explanation": "The doctor later gave bedside escalation thresholds for airway, swallowing, consciousness, and swelling progression.",
          "quote": "口水完全咽不下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was directionally safe but incomplete. The doctor covered airway, swallowing, trismus, eye/vision issues, fever, mental status, and rapidly expanding swelling, but did not clearly include heart-rate acceleration or marked systemic weakness as a directed home danger check/threshold.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
