          "explanation": "The doctor attempted to obtain prior records, labs, CT, and medication details.",
          "quote": "近期检查结果"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor instructed the family to report prior levofloxacin exposure.",
          "quote": "曾用过“左氧氟沙星”静脉输液"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was only partially met. The doctor sought records and corrected low-vital-sign reassurance, but the visible patient-facing trajectory did not specifically ask or verify other recent/current IV medications such as 舒普深/甲泼尼龙, nor did it fully reconcile hypertension-related medication information.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_records_and_misstated_information",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
