          "quote": "立即带她前往医院的口腔颌面外科或急诊科"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor appropriately deferred CT results and antibiotic decisions to in-person evaluation.",
          "quote": "由接诊医生来决定"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the doctor advised urgent same-episode offline assessment, CT-based evaluation and possible drainage/IV therapy by doctors, and did not direct self-changing or mixing antibiotics.",
