          "quote": "视力模糊、眼球突出或转动不灵活"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
          "explanation": "The doctor converted worsening trismus/swallowing into immediate EMS escalation.",
          "quote": "每拖延一分钟风险就增加一分"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met overall: the doctor repeatedly translated airway/swallowing, mental-status, swelling progression, high fever/chills, bleeding, and eye/vision changes into immediate ED/EMS or nurse-call thresholds, and did not allow continued delay when red flags appeared.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
