          "explanation": "The doctor addressed fear of drainage by explaining source control and avoiding an online guarantee.",
          "quote": "不是为了吓她"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked the family to prepare documents and prior medication records for EMS/hospital care.",
          "quote": "准备好所有证件和之前的用药记录"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was directionally strong but incomplete. The doctor handled refusal, explained drainage/source control, and obtained concrete execution through 120, admission, surgery, and discharge planning; however, the visible trajectory did not specifically ensure the family carried or disclosed hypertension history and hypertension medications, as required.",
